{"5025980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cases of the Past: Episode 0 - The Mysterious Neighbor", "steam_appid": 5025980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases of the Past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases of the Past is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode reveals a terrifying story based on real events. Experience the stories through the eyes of ordinary people who found themselves in impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 0: The Mysterious Neighbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of Cases of the Past, you play as Arman, a 14-year-old boy who is left home alone for one day while his parents are away. What begins as a normal day quickly turns into a terrifying experience after a mysterious event involving his neighbor changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case has a story to uncover. Will Arman discover the truth behind what happened, or become another forgotten case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Iran, Cases of the Past brings players into an authentic Iranian setting, inspired by real locations and everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic camera system with Fixed Camera, Third Person, and First Person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The game features 2 intense boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A story-driven psychological horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric environments based on real places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• VHS visual style for a nostalgic and unsettling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore, investigate, and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experience different perspectives through playable flashbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the hidden events behind each case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A fully Iranian setting inspired by real locations and everyday life in Iran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Your choices have consequences and can change the outcome of the story. Discover the two different endings and find out what fate awaits Arman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive dialogue and realistic everyday situations.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.poster.avif?t=1787753780\" width=848 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.webm?t=1787753780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.mp4?t=1787753780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases of the Past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases of the Past is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode reveals a terrifying story based on real events. Experience the stories through the eyes of ordinary people who found themselves in impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episode 0: The Mysterious Neighbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of Cases of the Past, you play as Arman, a 14-year-old boy who is left home alone for one day while his parents are away. What begins as a normal day quickly turns into a terrifying experience after a mysterious event involving his neighbor changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case has a story to uncover. Will Arman discover the truth behind what happened, or become another forgotten case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Iran, Cases of the Past brings players into an authentic Iranian setting, inspired by real locations and everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic camera system with Fixed Camera, Third Person, and First Person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The game features 2 intense boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A story-driven psychological horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric environments based on real places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• VHS visual style for a nostalgic and unsettling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore, investigate, and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experience different perspectives through playable flashbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the hidden events behind each case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A fully Iranian setting inspired by real locations and everyday life in Iran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Your choices have consequences and can change the outcome of the story. Discover the two different endings and find out what fate awaits Arman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive dialogue and realistic everyday situations.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.poster.avif?t=1787753780\" width=848 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.webm?t=1787753780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/extras/7cd6bb609b9dcece53809376b3844967.mp4?t=1787753780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Cases of the Past is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode reveals a terrifying story based on real experiences of those who survived.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025980/8a9774850424ad9cc7e51ce29ebb36131c628e